Station change of 2026-10-16 07:28 UTC, recorded after the fact.

Applies to /opt/fanum-voice/fanum-voice-core.py on the PBX.

  before: 50dc8af71151ab99dba0f5e0f3c35372b8793992cc2341f5eac3287caee3686d  (voice-core-crm-opening.patch)
  after:  80292277924ec452586357d73ddc20665ae76b24f5668bf806698514fd007b63

Not made from this repository and left no backup on the station; recovered on
2026-10-20 by reading the live file when voice-core-demo-max-seconds.patch
refused to install over an unexpected hash. What it does:
- every new call is in Azerbaijani; another language only when the caller
  explicitly asks for a named language in this call (EXPLICIT_LANGUAGE_POLICY,
  appended to every instruction and again after the call continuation);
- a caller turn sends the model a language-control note before activityStart;
- Turkish joins az/ru/en; fresh-recovery ask-repeat sentences in ru/en/tr;
- transcription language detection never changes the call's language.

